  id: graze
  displayName: Graze
  description: M3 passive wildlife. Peaceful herd animal. Drops raw_meat - feeds
    the combat sandbox AND the synergy sandbox (Combustible_Wet in a boiler reduces
    efficiency; can be smoked/dried into jerky at the Drying Rack).
  behaviors:
  - Travels in herds of 4-8.
  - Flees if attacked or approached aggressively.
  - Tameable in later milestones (M2 acceptance only needs the kill-and-drop loop).
  habitat: Lowlands Fauna
  dropItemIds:
  - raw_meat x2-3
  - Hide x1-2
  isTameable: 1
  isPassive: 1
  isAggressive: 1
  baseHealth: 50
  baseSpeed: 3
